{"unit_id": "tag:01OA:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>-模（modules）的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。由《模（Modules）》中的引理<REF_0001>可知，对称代数（algebra）<MATH_0004>（由<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上构成）是<MATH_0007>-代数（algebras）的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。注意，它由次数（degree）<MATH_0008>的部分在<MATH_0009>上生成（generated）。因此，可以将上一节的构造应用于它，具体见引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "对称代数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底空间的类型"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "拟凝聚层的取值对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "源中给定的模层"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所引引理所在的章节名称"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "对称代数", "context": "此处原词受 symmetric 修饰，汉语合译"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所得拟凝聚层的取值对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "对称代数作为一种层"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "分次构造中的生成次数"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "指定次数的部分在底代数上生成整个代数"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-模（module）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>读者可能以为这里会要求<MATH_0004>有限局部自由（finite locally free）。为与<REF_0001>保持一致，我们不作此要求。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。我们记<MATH_0005>，并称其为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>与<MATH_0006>关联的射影丛（projective bundle associated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。记号<MATH_0007>表示可逆（invertible）的<MATH_0008>-模（module）（见引理<REF_0002>），称为第<MATH_0009>次<TEXTITOPEN_0002>结构层扭转（twist of the structure sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "projective bundle associated", "target_term": "射影丛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "twist of the structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层扭转"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义的底空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "对给定模的条件"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定的拟凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "脚注提及但不要求的条件"}, {"source_term": "projective bundle associated", "target_term": "射影丛", "context": "由给定模关联得到的丛，关联对象在定语中给出"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "引理所给的模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "记号所指的可逆模"}, {"source_term": "twist of the structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层扭转", "context": "按次数编号的结构层扭转"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01OA:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由引理<REF_0001>可知，存在典范（canonical）的<MATH_0001>-模同态（module homomorphisms）\n<MATHSEG_0001>等价地<MATHSEG_0002>\n这对所有<MATH_0002>均成立。特别地，当<MATH_0003>时，有\n<MATHSEG_0003>等价地<MATHSEG_0004>\n且映射（map）<MATH_0004>由引理<REF_0002>可知是满射（surjection）。这是记住我们如何对<MATH_0005>的构造作归一化（normalized）的一种好方法。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n注意，在一些参考文献中，概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>只在<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>上有限局部自由（finite locally free）时才有定义。此外，有时<MATH_0009>实际上定义为这里的<MATH_0010>，其中<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>的对偶（dual）（并且只在<MATH_0013>有限局部自由（finite locally free）时才这样定义）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n设<MATH_0014>、<MATH_0015>、<MATH_0016>如定义<REF_0003>所述。设<MATH_0017>为概形（scheme），其底为<MATH_0018>。设<MATH_0019>为满射（surjection），其中<MATH_0020>是可逆（invertible）的<MATH_0021>-模（module）。诱导出的分次（graded）<MATH_0022>-代数映射（algebra map）\n<MATH_0023>\n对应于态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0024>\n它是<MATH_0025>上的态射。这是由于我们将相对射影谱（relative Proj）构造为一个概形（scheme），它表示（representing）函子（functor）<MATH_0026>，见第<REF_0004>节。反过来，给定态射（morphism）<MATH_0027>，其底为<MATH_0028>，我们可以令<MATH_0029>，并令<MATH_0030>等于沿<MATH_0031>对典范（canonical）满射（surjection）<MATH_0032>的拉回（pullback）。由引理<REF_0005>，这两种构造在由二元组<MATH_0033>的同构类（isomorphism classes）组成的集合（set）与由态射（morphisms）<MATH_0034>（在<MATH_0035>上）组成的集合（set）之间给出互逆（inverse）的双射（bijections）。因此，<MATH_0036>表示（represents）如下函子（functor），该函子把<MATH_0037>对应到一个集合（set），其元素是<MATH_0038>-模（module）意义下<MATH_0039>的商（quotients），且局部自由（locally free）、秩（rank）为<MATH_0040>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "module homomorphisms", "target_term": "模同态"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "normalized", "target_term": "归一化"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "dual", "target_term": "对偶"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "互逆"}, {"source_term": "bijections", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "represents", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "locally free", "target_term": "局部自由"}, {"source_term": "rank", "target_term": "秩"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "无需额外选择的模同态"}, {"source_term": "module homomorphisms", "target_term": "模同态", "context": "引理给出的模之间的同态"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "特定次数下取得的映射"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射", "context": "引理保证该映射满射"}, {"source_term": "normalized", "target_term": "归一化", "context": "构造的规范约定"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "其他文献定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "有些文献采用的定义条件"}, {"source_term": "dual", "target_term": "对偶", "context": "其他定义中改用的对偶对象"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "其他文献改用对偶时的条件"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定的底概形上的对象"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射", "context": "给定的可逆模的商映射"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "给定满射的目标模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定满射的目标"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "诱导的代数映射所保留的分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射", "context": "由给定满射诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "与诱导的代数映射对应的态射"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱", "context": "由函子表示给出的相对构造"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "表示所引函子的对象"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示", "context": "概形表示函子的关系"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "相对射影谱所表示的函子"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "逆向构造给定的态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "用于拉回的满射无须额外选择"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射", "context": "逆向构造中被拉回的映射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "沿给定态射得到所需满射的操作"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类", "context": "按同构分类的二元组"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "由二元组的同构类组成"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二个集合的元素"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "由底上的态射组成"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "互逆", "context": "两种构造给出的双射的关系"}, {"source_term": "bijections", "target_term": "双射", "context": "两种构造在两个集合间给出的对应"}, {"source_term": "represents", "target_term": "表示", "context": "射影丛与所述函子的关系"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "赋予指定商所成集合的函子"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "函子所赋予的对象"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "取商所用的线性结构"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商", "context": "函子所赋予的集合中的商"}, {"source_term": "locally free", "target_term": "局部自由", "context": "所取商的局部条件"}, {"source_term": "rank", "target_term": "秩", "context": "局部自由商的指定秩"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0FCY:statement", "translation": "向量空间（vector space）的射影（Projective）空间<OWNARGEND_0001>设<MATH_0001>为域（field）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>-向量空间（vector space）。对应的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>射影（projective）空间<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是<MATH_0004>-概形（scheme）\n<MATH_0005>\n其中<MATH_0006>是由<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>上构成的对称（symmetric）代数（algebra）。当然，<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>时成立，因为此时<MATH_0011>的对称（symmetric）代数（algebra）同构（isomorphic）于具有<MATH_0012>个变量（variables）的多项式环（polynomial ring）。若将<MATH_0013>视为<MATH_0014>上的拟凝聚模（coherent module），则<MATH_0015>是<MATH_0016>上对应的射影（projective）空间丛。由以上讨论，一个<MATH_0017>-值点（valued point）<MATH_0018>（属于<MATH_0019>）对应于一个满射（surjection），即<MATH_0020>-向量空间（vector spaces）之间的<MATH_0021>，且有<MATH_0022>。\n更一般地，设<MATH_0023>为概形（scheme），其底为<MATH_0024>。设<MATH_0025>为可逆（invertible）的<MATH_0026>-模（module）。设<MATH_0027>是<MATH_0028>-线性（linear）映射（map），使得<MATH_0029>作为<MATH_0030>-模（module）由<MATH_0031>的像（image）中的截面（sections）生成（generated）。那么，由以上讨论得到一个典范态射（canonical morphism）\n<MATH_0032>\n它是<MATH_0033>上的概形（schemes）之间的态射，且存在同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0034>，并且<MATH_0035>与复合（composition）<MATH_0036>一致。见引理<REF_0001>。如果<MATH_0037>是子空间（subspace），则将上面构造的态射（morphism）简记为<MATH_0038>。\n如果<MATH_0039>且选取基（basis）<MATH_0040>（属于<MATH_0041>），则图（diagram）\n<MATH_0042>\n交换（commutative），其中<MATH_0043>，<MATH_0044>如第<REF_0002>节所述，且右侧的竖直箭头（arrow）对应于同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0045>，该同构将<MATH_0046>送到<MATH_0047>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "Projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "symmetric", "target_term": "对称"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "symmetric", "target_term": "对称"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "variables", "target_term": "变量"}, {"source_term": "polynomial ring", "target_term": "多项式环"}, {"source_term": "coherent module", "target_term": "拟凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "valued point", "target_term": "值点"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "linear", "target_term": "线性"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "subspace", "target_term": "子空间"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间", "context": "标题中用来构造射影空间的对象"}, {"source_term": "Projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "标题中所构造的空间的类型"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "向量空间的标量域"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间", "context": "给定的线性空间"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "由给定向量空间得到的空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "对应的射影空间作为底上的概形"}, {"source_term": "symmetric", "target_term": "对称", "context": "初次给出构造射影空间所用的代数类型"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "在给定底上形成的对称代